# This file is copied verbatim to the site root by the zensical build (it is an
# ordinary docs_dir asset, not a plugin output) and read from there by GitLab
# Pages. Zensical has no redirects plugin — it implements search, offline, mike
# and mkdocstrings only — so this file is the whole mechanism.
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>. Paths are site-root-relative.
# Verify after a build with: zensical build && cat site/_redirects

